Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:25:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] feat(compute-providers): add Fly.io Sprites sandbox
 client

Implements ComputeProviderClient over the Sprites REST API
(https://api.sprites.dev). Exec is the simple HTTP POST form, wrapped in a
shell that prints an exit sentinel because the endpoint exposes no exit-code
channel. Detached commands write a log file that is polled through the
filesystem API for streaming and lookup.
